{"id":"vod_hh_123577","vodId":"123577","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"亚人","name_cn":"亚人","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"OAD2","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/33d03caeafa57421f56c877a87e057bd.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上，存在着能够永生不死的人类，即使遭到致命的重创，也会在短时间内迅速恢复，人们称之为“亚人”。永井圭（宫野真守 配音）是一名平凡的高中生，某日，一场车祸让他亚人的身份曝光，随即遭到了有关政府部门的高价通缉，在曾经的好友海斗（细谷佳正 配音）的帮助下，永井圭踏上了永无止境的逃亡之路。\n　　途中，永井圭结识了同为亚人的佐藤（大冢芳忠 配音），佐藤想将永井圭纳入自己暗中组建的亚人团体之中，敏感的永井圭却发现了佐藤隐藏极深的真实面目和目的。亚人一直遭到政府的迫害和残酷研究，因此佐藤企图通过一系列恐怖袭击活动来夺回属于亚人的权利，永井圭则投靠了亚人管理委员会的户崎（樱井孝宏 配音），在他的带领下对抗强大的佐藤。在亚人和人类之间，一场充满了硝烟和鲜血的战争即将拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-01-28 22:00:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADnq39e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erk0ZA2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b686oOOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrOX3Ge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYOQGja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG6ZnpKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erk0ZOLa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejR2Qpye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyP8lK6b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYOQG1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYgwxQa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ64O7Qe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQW1J9Gd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD1","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eVOmpXXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD2","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADnqRle/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:00.761Z"}